{"canonicalKey":"experience.timeline_as_metaphor","contentHash":"709c0d06d8ad346875bb142267d6a2b2df521d5619d4123f7c66d33b6414de2d","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"时间线是整理经验的主观隐喻。时间线是一种整理过去、现在和未来感受的隐喻工具，不应被当作记忆准确性或因果关系的证明。"}
